findings.description:
The initiative plan says Distribution & Scaling (620) "need not be designed proactively". This document nonetheless takes on:
- an "Aggregation interface support" slice whose dependency (world-server multi-resolution) is unscheduled;
- GPU-offload constraints ("no dynamic allocation") imposed on the v1 force interface;
- two Technical Considerations paragraphs on the 1M–4M tiers.

Cut the aggregation slice from this architecture and reduce the GPU material to a single non-preclusion statement. Keep the subset mask only if the dt issue above is resolved; otherwise it is an unused parameter.
